## Third-party pretrained models and data

Pretrained models and word vectors are not vendored in the repository; they are
downloaded at runtime (`ruintona/my_experiments/utils/pretrained.py`) or loaded
from Hugging Face Hub by the experiment/evaluation scripts. Their licenses are:

| Component | License | Source |
|---|---|---|
| FastText `cc.ru.300.bin` word vectors | CC BY-SA 3.0 | <https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/crawl-vectors.html> |
| RuBERT (`rubert-base-cased`, original by DeepPavlov) | Apache-2.0 | <https://huggingface.co/DeepPavlov/rubert-base-cased> |
| wav2vec2 XLS-R 300M (Facebook/Meta) | Apache-2.0 | <https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-xls-r-300m> |
| HuBERT-large SER fine-tune on Dusha (xbgoose) | Apache-2.0 | <https://huggingface.co/xbgoose/hubert-speech-emotion-recognition-russian-dusha-finetuned> |
| Whisper large-v3 SER fine-tune (firdhokk) | Apache-2.0 (base `openai/whisper-large-v3` is MIT) | <https://huggingface.co/firdhokk/speech-emotion-recognition-with-openai-whisper-large-v3> |
| WavLM-BERT fusion SER on RESD (Aniemore) | MIT | <https://huggingface.co/Aniemore/wavlm-bert-fusion-s-emotion-russian-resd> |

